ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa061 - Sewing of thin faces takes excessive time during seam-edge creation
 * Shell of 12 ribbon-thin faces, each 100mm long x 0.001mm wide, sharing
 * the long horizontal edges between adjacent ribbons. Catalog calls for ~400;
 * fixture is a scaled representative -- topology pattern is the same. */
